{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e13-scene-05",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "这些俗事是我们抛不开的烦恼  (Worldly Troubles We Cannot Shake Off)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Arriving at a serene island retreat overseas, Bu Xiaogu meets the reclusive lyricist-composer who once shared a pure bond with Chun Yuqiao and gently explains Xingtian's crisis. Listen to Bu Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "按规矩，我应该怎么称呼您？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "阳子，您好。是淳于先生告诉我您的住处。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我只是他的下属。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您跟他也是知己？我听说您在这边是为了研究音乐。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "像您这样的词曲作家，听到您还搞音乐，真的是令人期待。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道您对俗事不在乎，您做音乐只是为了音乐本身。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是前几年您与白石公司签订了一份合约，按照法律来讲，对您的权益是有所损害的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果您愿意出来主张一下，对我们的公司会起到非常大的帮助。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "毕竟这些俗事对淳于总还有我们来说，也是抛不开的尘世烦恼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的吗？太谢谢您了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是您这么了解他，为什么要离开他？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我以为在这儿都得这么说话呢！快走吧，我赶着回上海！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "按规矩，我应该怎么称呼您？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'By proper etiquette, how should I address you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "阳子，您好。是淳于先生告诉我您的住处。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, Yangzi. Mr Chun Yu told me where to find your home.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我只是他的下属。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am simply one of his subordinates.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您跟他也是知己？我听说您在这边是为了研究音乐。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you a kindred spirit of his as well? I heard you settled here to study music.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "像您这样的词曲作家，听到您还搞音乐，真的是令人期待。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hearing that a songwriter like you is still creating music truly fills people with anticipation.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道您对俗事不在乎，您做音乐只是为了音乐本身。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know you care nothing for worldly affairs and make music purely for music's sake.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是前几年您与白石公司签订了一份合约，按照法律来讲，对您的权益是有所损害的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet a few years ago you signed a contract with Baishi that legally infringed upon your own rights.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果您愿意出来主张一下，对我们的公司会起到非常大的帮助。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you are willing to step forward and assert your rights, it will help our company immensely.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "毕竟这些俗事对淳于总还有我们来说，也是抛不开的尘世烦恼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'After all, for Mr Chun Yu and the rest of us, these worldly tangles are troubles we cannot simply shake off.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的吗？太谢谢您了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Truly? Thank you so very much!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是您这么了解他，为什么要离开他？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet since you understand him so deeply, why did you leave him back then?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我以为在这儿都得这么说话呢！快走吧，我赶着回上海！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I thought everyone had to speak in classical poetry around here! Let's hurry — I'm rushing back to Shanghai!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "按规矩，我应该怎么称呼您？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "阳子，您好。是淳于先生告诉我您的住处。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我只是他的下属。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您跟他也是知己？我听说您在这边是为了研究音乐。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "像您这样的词曲作家，听到您还搞音乐，真的是令人期待。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道您对俗事不在乎，您做音乐只是为了音乐本身。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是前几年您与白石公司签订了一份合约，按照法律来讲，对您的权益是有所损害的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果您愿意出来主张一下，对我们的公司会起到非常大的帮助。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "毕竟这些俗事对淳于总还有我们来说，也是抛不开的尘世烦恼。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的吗？太谢谢您了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是您这么了解他，为什么要离开他？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我以为在这儿都得这么说话呢！快走吧，我赶着回上海！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Grateful to Yuqiao for keeping her memory pure, the songwriter readily signs Xingtian's authorization and gifts a brand-new song, sending Xiaogu racing home on her companion's family jet. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
